      "content": "I understand the trade-offs you're highlighting, but the Board has already signaled that the transition to the rule-based framework is a mandatory compliance measure for 2026. The transparency requirement is non-negotiable for political reasons. \n\nGiven that this transition is going ahead, I need you to focus your report on how we can best facilitate this migration. Can you outline a timeline for the decommissioning of the current neural architecture and the integration of the new framework?",
